        "id": "ch14_5_1-2",
        "text": "Apache Kafka will create a topic specifically for this subscription. It is provided to us as\na topicId attribute. We will use this topicId attribute to connect to Apache Kafka to\nreceive events. This explains why we call general topics categories in Apache Kafka. The\nexpiresAt attribute indicates the time this subscription will expire.\nOnce a subscription is ready, we can connect to Apache Kafka to receive events,\nas explained in the next subsection.",
